Ms_Nair: Good morning, everyone! This Friday, we’ll be celebrating our annual School Culture Festival! Each class will prepare dances, decorations, and food representing a local tradition.
Rohan: Let’s do the same celebration we did last year—it was so fun!
characters/Diya: What about something new that includes everyone’s background?
Rohan: Come on, Ayaan never joins anyway. He doesn’t even celebrate the same things as us.
Ayaan: I feel left out... but maybe this year, I should say something.
- Speak up and share your cultural tradition with the class.
